# Everything the tools pull off a device: sweeps, archive images, PPK2
# captures, bench scratch. Hundreds of MB, and cited from docs/ by relative
# path — layout and rationale in docs/build-system.md, resolver in
# tools/artifacts.py.
/local/

# Safety net for `history.py backup -o`, whose path is whatever was typed.
hist-*.bin

# Byte-compiled pre-build helpers (pre_build.py imports them under SCons)
scripts/__pycache__/
